    "Dynamisch (-D)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamic (-D)"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Tunnel kind: dynamic SOCKS proxy"
    },
    "Een SOCKS5-proxy op dit apparaat. De server maakt de verbindingen, dus het verkeer lijkt daarvandaan te komen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A SOCKS5 proxy on this device. The server makes the connections, so the traffic appears to come from there."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Explains what a dynamic forward does"
    },
    "Een naam mag geen schuine streep bevatten en kan niet . of .. zijn.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A name cannot contain a slash, and cannot be . or .."
          }
