      },
      "comment": "Explains why a proposed filename is not allowed"
    },
    "Een profiel bepaalt lettertype, kleuren en cursor. Je kunt er een per host of per groep instellen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A profile sets the font, colours and cursor. You can assign one per host or per group."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Empty state body for the terminal profile list"
    },
    "Een tunnel loopt over deze verbinding en stopt als die wegvalt. Tunnels die automatisch starten komen bij elke herverbinding terug.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A tunnel runs over this connection and stops when it drops. Tunnels that start automatically come back on every reconnection."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Footer explaining that tunnels live and die with the connection"
    },
